-- here; where the same item + pack size appeared more than once (counting
-- multiple physical tubs/tins/packs), the quantities were summed into a
-- single row rather than kept as duplicate lines. Category is left NULL so
-- the existing lazy AI backfill in familyInventoryApiResponse (GET)
-- classifies all of them in one combined call on next load, instead of
-- costing one AI call per item.

